# Filter-map-reduce composition uses one symbolic bounded-list semantics.

```catala
declaration scope ComposedListGoal:
  input values content list of integer
  output result content integer

scope ComposedListGoal:
  definition result equals
    if (minimum of
          (map each value among
             (list of value among values such that value >= 0)
           to (if value > 10 then 100 else value))
        or if list empty then -1) > 5
    then 1
    else 0
```
